<title>EGYPT: Kabo nine-month results.</title>
<headline>Kabo nine-month results.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kabo/Nasr Clothing and Textiles made after-tax profits of 6.872 million pounds ($2.02 million) in the first nine months of the financial year 1996/7, against 2.868 million in the same period of 1995/6, according to stock exchange figures available on Sunday. The years start July 1.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
